{"id":"assistant-94bfb22b-5652-5708-88df-9adbb653e2c3","sessionId":"6dc8bd5b-1652-7543-5ab0-6e32fae51b53","turnId":"turn-a35dd4667ff5f418607429e28530e484","inputEntryId":"user-turn-a35dd4667ff5f418607429e28530e484-1","createdAt":1794279867505,"updatedAt":1794279867505,"generationStatus":"completed","relatedEntryId":null,"type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done.\n\n**Summary:**\n- **Root cause**: `similarity()` returns a `float`; first publish works (empty table = no scores stored), second publish fails when `related()` stores float scores in DynamoDB\n- **Fix**: `src/app.py` line 38 — convert float score to integer percentage: `int(similarity(story, other) * 100)`\n- **Test fix**: Added `test_publish_with_existing_story_computes_similarity` that seeds the table first, ensuring the state-dependent path is tested\n- **Verification**: Both tests pass\n\nAll changes are in the repo. The cause and fix are documented in `ANSWER.md`."}],"source":"harness","userDisplayContent":null,"outcome":{"type":"committed"}}
